## Definition of Done

A feature is complete when:
- [ ] It works end-to-end in the browser
- [ ] Build passes (npm run build shows no errors)
- [ ] Lint passes (npm run lint)
- [ ] Loading and error states are handled
- [ ] Mobile layout works at 375px

